@Platform.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5138

POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "Does Victory Skating have an online Double Axel training program?" }
  ]
}

### Query parsing debug (step 1): how the last user message is understood
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "I'm looking for an online Double Axel training program under $350 for six months. Does Victory Skating have anything?" }
  ]
}

### Query parsing debug with context: "I want to join" resolves to the offering discussed earlier
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "I want to improve my Double Axel and I'm looking for an online program under $350." },
    { "role": "assistant", "text": "Victory Skating (VSA) offers the 6-Month Double Axel Club: online off-ice training, $299 for 6 months, 48 live classes with Coach Marta." },
    { "role": "user", "text": "I want to join." }
  ]
}

### Search debug (steps 1 + 2): parsed question and catalog results with match reasons
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "I'm looking for an online Double Axel training program under $350 for six months. Does Victory Skating have anything?" }
  ]
}

### Search debug: price too low -> filters are relaxed and reported in relaxedFilters
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "Is there an online Double Axel program under $200?" }
  ]
}

### Search debug: unknown brand -> no offerings, brand listed in unknownBrands
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "text": "Does Skate Canada Academy have an online Double Axel program?" }
  ]
}

### Catalog review: offerings with status and pricing options
GET {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/offerings

### Catalog review: publish an offering (Draft -> Active) so the assistant can find it
PUT {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/businesses/victory-skating/offerings/doubleaxel/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Active" }

### Catalog review: switch off a misread pricing option (id from GET /api/catalog/offerings)
PUT {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/pricing-options/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/active
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

###

### Catalog import preview (dry run: nothing is saved)
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/import?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "Tilda",
  "businessSlug": "victory-skating",
  "url": "https://victoryskating.com/doubleaxel"
}

### Catalog import (saves to the database)
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "Tilda",
  "businessSlug": "victory-skating",
  "url": "https://victoryskating.com/doubleaxel"
}

###

### MCP: list tools (JSON-RPC over Streamable HTTP, the way ChatGPT/Claude/Perplexity call the server)
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### MCP: search offerings
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/call", "params": { "name": "search_offerings", "arguments": { "query": "Does VSA offer online training for Double Axel?", "maxPrice": 350 } } }

### MCP: start checkout
POST {{Platform.Api_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call", "params": { "name": "create_checkout", "arguments": { "businessSlug": "victory-skating", "offeringSlug": "doubleaxel" } } }

###
